: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">1. 성적취소 대상 : 2015학년도 전기 졸업예정자에 한함</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">2. 신청기간 : 2016.01.13.(수)~01.15.(금)까지</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">3. 신청장소 : 해당 종합학사행정실</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">4. 성적취소 범위 : 2014학년도까지 이수 교과목에 한하여 아래 각 호에 해당하는 성적은 취소가능</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">&nbsp; 1) 7학기이상 등록자에 한하여 6학점 이내의 성적(재학 중 1회 취소가능)</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ※ 졸업예정자로 중 성적취소 이력있는 학생은 취소하지 못함</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">&nbsp; 2) 졸업예정자로서 그 성적이 \"F\"인 과목</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">5. 신청방법 : 성적취소 신청원 작성→해당 종합학사행정실 제출</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">&nbsp; 1) 성적증명서 제출 생략</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">&nbsp; 2) 정확한 성적취소 처리를 위해 성적 취소 신청원 작성 시 교과목코드, 교과목명을 정확히 기재하여 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALI